tvdb_show","id":"471791","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"106413","synopsis":"Kaori, who had suggested the date herself, becomes flustered upon learning that Sota and Ayano went to a hotel. Still, as Sota's sister, she tries to mediate between them... Meanwhile, Sakura, Kyoka, and Yuria, having heard the whole story, come up with a bizarre theory: Since they're also members of the girls' volleyball club like Ayano, they should have the right to do the same thing! And so, they begin seducing Sota!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qKwZTmFo6KVZlgSS6eiuoKsNd9Q.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Kaori, who had suggested the date herself, becomes flustered upon learning that Sota and Ayano went to a hotel. Still, as Sota's sister, she tries to mediate between them... Meanwhile, Sakura, Kyoka, and Yuria, having heard the whole story, come up with a bizarre theory: Since they're also members of the girls' volleyball club like Ayano, they should have the right to do the same thing! And so, they begin seducing Sota!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qKwZTmFo6KVZlgSS6eiuoKsNd9Q.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19901","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204319","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"63248","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"316715","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471791","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"106608","synopsis":"Everyone is present at the girls' dormitory, now with the club president, Sanae, who had been absent for a while due to family circumstances, returning to the volleyball club. Sanae, a libero specializing in defense, is petite despite being on the volleyball team, and Sota finds himself drawn to her, who is shorter than him. The group decides to hold a Genghis Khan party to celebrate Sanae's return and Sota's appointment as coach. But that night, an unexpected hint of romance awaited Sota!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qK7vwBT02MIvHTfRQwBLpqDJOUX.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Everyone is present at the girls' dormitory, now with the club president, Sanae, who had been absent for a while due to family circumstances, returning to the volleyball club. Sanae, a libero specializing in defense, is petite despite being on the volleyball team, and Sota finds himself drawn to her, who is shorter than him. The group decides to hold a Genghis Khan party to celebrate Sanae's return and Sota's appointment as coach. But that night, an unexpected hint of romance awaited Sota!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qK7vwBT02MIvHTfRQwBLpqDJOUX.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19901","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204319","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"63248","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"316715","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471791","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"106769","synopsis":"Sakura is always full of jokes. One day, when Sota tells her that she'd be cute if she just acted normal, a certain memory resurfaces. Back in elementary school, Sakura, already tall for her age, played the clown while spending her days with her male friend, Takeshi. Eventually, they entered middle school and both joined the volleyball club. However, a rift gradually formed between Sakura, blessed with physique and talent, and Takeshi, who was not...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kjClKB3xZJ70nyXLCAOSwTvz5Gr.jpg","m