t to recruit Sota as her substitute player. The tournament's grand prize was... the right to do whatever they wanted with Sota?! Reluctant but needing to protect himself, Sota joins the game. Meanwhile, Kaori seems to have her own thoughts on the matter...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lWCqXPhcaFVztbbpoIOMwFcD9Gc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19901","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204319","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"63248","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"316715","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471791","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"107387","synopsis":"Last night's events left Sota feeling awkward. Kaori forcefully tries to act like nothing happened, but Sota's words about Sanae stirs something within her. Amidst this, a secret about Kyoka is revealed?! While it was quietly known among the club members, the shock of it coming out causes Kyoka to flee. Mental care is also an important job for the dorm manager and coach... Sota hurriedly chases after her!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/olr7B3WvQaK2SamFTKEMBbe2gob.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Last night's events left Sota feeling awkward. Kaori forcefully tries to act like nothing happened, but Sota's words about Sanae stirs something within her. Amidst this, a secret about Kyoka is revealed?! While it was quietly known among the club members, the shock of it coming out causes Kyoka to flee. Mental care is also an important job for the dorm manager and coach... Sota hurriedly chases after her!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/olr7B3WvQaK2SamFTKEMBbe2gob.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNu