_show","id":"471791","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"107707","synopsis":"The girls from the dorm head to the shopping district for supplies. They came to buy groceries, but Sota gets thoroughly swayed again by the members' self-indulgent, free-spirited actions. After much commotion, they manage to finish shopping and discover they can try their luck at a lucky draw. The grand prize is a pair of hot spring trip vouchers! Kaoru, concerned about Sanae and Sota's relationship, wins it and wants to give it to them, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hYu2M8oXcfg3ecjd2ZqGJTuRajM.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"The girls from the dorm head to the shopping district for supplies. They came to buy groceries, but Sota gets thoroughly swayed again by the members' self-indulgent, free-spirited actions. After much commotion, they manage to finish shopping and discover they can try their luck at a lucky draw. The grand prize is a pair of hot spring trip vouchers! Kaoru, concerned about Sanae and Sota's relationship, wins it and wants to give it to them, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hYu2M8oXcfg3ecjd2ZqGJTuRajM.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19901","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204319","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"63248","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"316715","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471791","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"107852","synopsis":"Today is Valentine's Day! Kaoru and Kyoka, with their tall figure and short hair, are treated like princesses and receive chocolates from their female fans. Seeing this, Sanae and Ayano decide they want to make some for Sota too, and eventually the whole club ends up making homemade chocolates. Kaoru also hands Sota the chocolate she made herself. It contains something not found in ordinary family chocolates...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6wZodLSB0KoHvMSaxMusxxX0xmK.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Today is Valentine's Day! Kaoru and Kyoka, with their tall figure and short hair, are treated like princesses and receive chocolates from their female fans. Seeing this, Sanae and Ayano decide they want to make some for Sota too, and eventually the whole club ends up making homemade chocolates. Kaoru also hands Sota the chocolate she made herself. It contains something not found in ordinary family chocolates...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6wZodLSB0KoHvMSaxMusxxX0xmK.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19901","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"204319","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"63248","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"316715","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"471791","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"107976","synopsis":"Kaoru couldn't shake the words Ayano had said to her on Valentine's Day night regarding her feelings for Sota. Then, in a sudden turn of events, Kaoru finds herself running out of the dorm in her nightclothes. Sota, who had followed her, invites her on a date. They go clothes shopping together, eat dinner, and drink out. But then, drunk, Kaoru declares she doesn't want to go home...!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8rZ8I3jp9fdXSFGpwZxlgmVGpi2.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Kaoru couldn't shake the words Ayano had said to her on Valentine's Day night regarding her feelings for Sota. Th